# Jing's "Trajectory", shortened. chunk 5 (job 500171) diverged: episodes ended
# after 5.3 steps (one chunk), crash -79 against -5 to -20 on every per-action
# arm, and end_goal_dist_frac 2.15 -- it finished twice as far from the goal as
# it started. Committing five actions to one observation makes a bad opening
# turn unrecoverable. Two actions keeps the trajectory idea with a recoverable
